{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "main_1_level_main_01-06_beg",
  "groupId": "main_1",
  "stageId": "main_01-06",
  "title": "灾难",
  "storyCode": "1-6",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_01-06_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "3ebb45120b5e540deb1dbd4194f22e13db2590fdc3fdca0099949ca131fc52eb",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第九关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "是的，他们不知道自己被浮士德跟踪。我从浮士德派回来的斥候那里了解到了一些情报。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "罗德岛确实被困在中城区的外围了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "虽然是些虫子，但他们也可能趁着天灾带来混乱逃跑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "以他们对切尔诺伯格现状的了解，说不定会干扰到我们的计划。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "——至少，把他们铲除掉没有任何坏处。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_011_talula_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_011_talula",
      "portraitKey": "char_011_talula",
      "text": "————"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "切尔诺伯格的混蛋，都是你们，都是你们，害得我们感染者变成这样！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "闪开！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "呜！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "这些人，只不过是在前仆后继地送死！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "临光",
      "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
      "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "整合运动怎么全都陷入了狂躁状态？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "为什么这个时候，这里会聚集着这么多整合运动？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "不合常理！整合运动根本没有坚守这里的理由！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "临光",
      "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
      "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "罗德岛干员们，不要退缩！击退整合运动，打开撤退路径！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_011_talula_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_011_talula",
      "portraitKey": "char_011_talula",
      "text": "————"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
      "text": "那些人就是情报中说的“罗德岛”？呵......很英勇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弑君者",
      "speakerToken": "char_1502_crowns",
      "operatorId": "char_1502_crowns",
      "portraitKey": "char_1502_crowns",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医疗干员",
      "speakerToken": "char_016_medic",
      "operatorId": "char_016_medic",
      "portraitKey": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "......啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫干员",
      "speakerToken": "char_013_riop",
      "operatorId": "char_013_riop",
      "portraitKey": "char_013_riop",
      "text": "......落石？这个时候？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "别停下！优先确保防线！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫干员",
      "speakerToken": "char_013_riop",
      "operatorId": "char_013_riop",
      "portraitKey": "char_013_riop",
      "text": "不对......是砸在建筑物上迸出来的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "你在说什么——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "来了！来了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "哈哈......我们感染者的救赎！普通人的末日！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "啊，啊啊——咕！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "啊，啊啊——咕！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "他是被什么东西......击倒的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "你们有谁......攻击了他？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "还是说，他是被......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "杜宾！天空......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "临光",
      "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
      "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "临光",
      "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
      "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "天空陷入了血色——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "临光",
      "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
      "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "“沸腾的乌云翻涌在火焰之中......”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerToken": "char_014_riope",
      "operatorId": "char_014_riope",
      "portraitKey": "char_014_riope",
      "text": "别惊慌！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "临光",
      "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
      "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "保护好自己！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "......我们还有机会，用行动去拯救自己的生命！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "“——大地陷入寂静，恐惧取走了他们的声音。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "“巨大的源石垂下头颅——”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "“——坠落，它坠落在死亡焦热的阴影。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弑君者",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "塔露拉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弑君者",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "要怎么做？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "————也许他们能自天灾中幸存。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "漏网之人，你去处理。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弑君者",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "虽然已经想到，整合运动要利用天灾复仇......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "没想到，他们居然会选择让天灾彻底毁灭切尔诺伯格——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "比起报复，这更像是宣誓......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "感染者的时代......吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医疗干员",
      "speakerToken": "char_016_medic",
      "operatorId": "char_016_medic",
      "portraitKey": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "啊......啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医疗干员",
      "speakerToken": "char_016_medic",
      "operatorId": "char_016_medic",
      "portraitKey": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "整个天空......都要掉下来了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫干员",
      "speakerToken": "char_013_riop",
      "operatorId": "char_013_riop",
      "portraitKey": "char_013_riop",
      "text": "小心！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医疗干员",
      "speakerToken": "char_016_medic",
      "operatorId": "char_016_medic",
      "portraitKey": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "那是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "清醒点！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医疗干员",
      "speakerToken": "char_016_medic",
      "operatorId": "char_016_medic",
      "portraitKey": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "——啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "保护医生，快带她去安全的地方！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫干员",
      "speakerToken": "char_013_riop",
      "operatorId": "char_013_riop",
      "portraitKey": "char_013_riop",
      "text": "明白！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerToken": "char_014_riope",
      "operatorId": "char_014_riope",
      "portraitKey": "char_014_riope",
      "text": "干员们，各自寻找安全位置！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "各小队！准备好......应对天灾！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
